---
/** Result headline. The page script fills `[data-r=eyebrow]` and `[data-r=headline]`; focus moves to the h2. */
---
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
  <div class="mono text-[11px] text-muted" data-r="eyebrow">Your result</div>
  <h2 tabindex="-1" data-r="headline" class="m-0 text-[clamp(32px,4.4vw,52px)] leading-[1] font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-2"></h2>
</div>
